{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:0", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 0, "condition": "current_single", "repetition": 0, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:24.546290+00:00", "payload_sha256": "36dae60a0eb567f88eef1530b2d8be0ae8e04c8b22704b572400917c24278d87", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 4872, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:29.418310+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2296, "completion_tokens": 331, "total_tokens": 2627, "reasoning_tokens": null}, "reply": "好的，这是一个简洁完整的示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def fetch_data(task_id: int):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    if task_id == 2:\n        raise ValueError(f\"任务 {task_id} 处理失败！\")\n    return f\"任务 {task_id} 的数据\"\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [fetch_data(1), fetch_data(2), fetch_data(3)]\n    \n    # 设置 return_exceptions=True，异常会被当作结果存入列表\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[错误] 任务 {i} 抛出异常: {type(res).__name__} - {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[成功] 任务 {i} 返回结果: {res}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**运行输出**：\n```text\n[成功] 任务 1 返回结果: 任务 1 的数据\n[错误] 任务 2 抛出异常: ValueError - 任务 2 处理失败！\n[成功] 任务 3 返回结果: 任务 3 的数据\n```\n\n这样就能在保证任务全部执行完毕的同时，逐一筛选出正常数据与捕获到的异常实例了。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:1", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 1, "condition": "split_pre_history", "repetition": 0, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:29.418805+00:00", "payload_sha256": "7604e81318b1d44f9278840f1fdad26afec94890221482999dbdc3bbbb27e8ff", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 4859, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:34.278011+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash-control", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2295, "completion_tokens": 347, "total_tokens": 2642, "reasoning_tokens": null}, "reply": "好的，给你准备了一个简洁完整的示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def fetch_data(task_id: int, should_fail: bool = False):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.5)\n    if should_fail:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Task-{task_id} 执行遇到错误\")\n    return f\"Task-{task_id} 数据加载完成\"\n\nasync def main():\n    # 创建一组任务，其中任务 2 模拟失败\n    tasks = [\n        fetch_data(1),\n        fetch_data(2, should_fail=True),\n        fetch_data(3),\n    ]\n\n    # 关键参数：return_exceptions=True\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历结果并使用 isinstance 区分\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[错误] 任务 {i} 失败，异常类型为 {type(res).__name__}: {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[成功] 任务 {i} 返回: {res}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n运行后的输出结果会是这样：\n\n```text\n[成功] 任务 1 返回: Task-1 数据加载完成\n[错误] 任务 2 失败，异常类型为 ValueError: Task-2 执行遇到错误\n[成功] 任务 3 返回: Task-3 数据加载完成\n```", "finish_reason": "stop"}
{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:2", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 2, "condition": "split_post_history", "repetition": 0, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:34.278562+00:00", "payload_sha256": "8cc865242963a7c88132b543ba06f9cef5733f794004c5020b704c0e9794cd5f", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 4753, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:39.031610+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2308, "completion_tokens": 777, "total_tokens": 3085, "reasoning_tokens": 454}, "reply": "好的，这是一个可以直接运行的完整示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def task_success(val: int):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    return f\"数据_{val}\"\n\nasync def task_fail():\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    raise ValueError(\"发生网络错误\")\n\nasync def main():\n    # 创建包含成功和失败的任务列表\n    tasks = [\n        task_success(1),\n        task_fail(),\n        task_success(2),\n    ]\n\n    # 设置 return_exceptions=True，异常会被当作返回值收集\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历并区分结果\n    for idx, item in enumerate(results):\n        if isinstance(item, Exception):\n            print(f\"任务 {idx} 失败: {type(item).__name__} - {item}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"任务 {idx} 成功: {item}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**运行输出：**\n```text\n任务 0 成功: 数据_1\n任务 1 失败: ValueError - 发生网络错误\n任务 2 成功: 数据_2\n```\n\n这样写就能保证即使中间的任务抛出异常，整个等待流程也不会中断，最后通过 `isinstance(..., Exception)` 就能干净地完成分流处理。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:3", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 3, "condition": "split_post_history", "repetition": 1, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:39.032204+00:00", "payload_sha256": "8cc865242963a7c88132b543ba06f9cef5733f794004c5020b704c0e9794cd5f", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 5729, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:44.761577+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash-control", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2308, "completion_tokens": 941, "total_tokens": 3249, "reasoning_tokens": 577}, "reply": "好的，这是一个完整的示例代码：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def fetch_data(item_id: int):\n    # 模拟耗时操作，当 item_id 为 2 时主动抛出异常\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    if item_id == 2:\n        raise ValueError(f\"ID {item_id} 数据处理失败\")\n    return f\"ID {item_id} 的处理结果\"\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [fetch_data(1), fetch_data(2), fetch_data(3)]\n    \n    # 启用 return_exceptions=True，异常会被当作结果返回，不会中断其它任务\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历检查结果类型\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"任务 {i} 失败 -> 异常类型: {type(res).__name__}, 信息: {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"任务 {i} 成功 -> 返回值: {res}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**运行输出：**\n```text\n任务 1 成功 -> 返回值: ID 1 的处理结果\n任务 2 失败 -> 异常类型: ValueError, 信息: ID 2 数据处理失败\n任务 3 成功 -> 返回值: ID 3 的处理结果\n```\n\n通过 `isinstance(res, Exception)` 即可清晰地将捕获到的异常对象与正常返回值分流处理。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:4", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 4, "condition": "split_pre_history", "repetition": 1, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:44.762071+00:00", "payload_sha256": "7604e81318b1d44f9278840f1fdad26afec94890221482999dbdc3bbbb27e8ff", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 3307, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:48.069660+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2295, "completion_tokens": 318, "total_tokens": 2613, "reasoning_tokens": null}, "reply": "好的，这是一个简洁完整的示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\n\nasync def fetch_data(task_id: int):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    if task_id == 2:\n        raise ValueError(f\"任务 {task_id} 遇到了错误\")\n    return f\"任务 {task_id} 的数据\"\n\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [fetch_data(1), fetch_data(2), fetch_data(3)]\n\n    # 传入 return_exceptions=True\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历结果并做类型判断\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[{i}] 失败: {type(res).__name__} - {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[{i}] 成功: {res}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**运行输出：**\n```text\n[1] 成功: 任务 1 的数据\n[2] 失败: ValueError - 任务 2 遇到了错误\n[3] 成功: 任务 3 的数据\n```\n\n这样就能保证即使 2 号任务抛出异常，1 号和 3 号任务依旧正常完成，并且所有结果都会按传入顺序整齐返回。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
{"id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:5", "anchor_id": "single_text:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 5, "condition": "current_single", "repetition": 1, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:48.070277+00:00", "payload_sha256": "36dae60a0eb567f88eef1530b2d8be0ae8e04c8b22704b572400917c24278d87", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 4202, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:05:52.272919+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash-control", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2296, "completion_tokens": 383, "total_tokens": 2679, "reasoning_tokens": null}, "reply": "这是一个完整的可运行示例，展示了如何使用 `return_exceptions=True` 并遍历区分正常结果与异常对象：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\n\nasync def fetch_data(task_id: int):\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.5)\n    # 模拟偶数任务正常返回，奇数任务抛出异常\n    if task_id % 2 != 0:\n        raise ValueError(f\"Task {task_id} 遇到了错误\")\n    return f\"Task {task_id} 数据获取成功\"\n\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [fetch_data(i) for i in range(1, 5)]\n\n    # return_exceptions=True 会捕获异常并作为元素存入结果列表\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    for i, res in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(res, Exception):\n            print(f\"[失败] 任务 {i} 异常: {type(res).__name__} - {res}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[成功] 任务 {i} 结果: {res}\")\n\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n**运行输出：**\n```text\n[失败] 任务 1 异常: ValueError - Task 1 遇到了错误\n[成功] 任务 2 结果: Task 2 数据获取成功\n[失败] 任务 3 异常: ValueError - Task 3 遇到了错误\n[成功] 任务 4 结果: Task 4 数据获取成功\n```\n\n这样即便利益于并发的所有任务都能执行完毕，外层也能清晰地拿到每个任务的最终状态。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
