{"id": "default_voice:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate:0", "anchor_id": "default_voice:technical_help:r0:t3:candidate", "sequence": 0, "condition": "split_pre_history", "repetition": 0, "started_at": "2026-10-03T16:07:10.404173+00:00", "payload_sha256": "915e555a7bb1f1ee937fbc6c5a90e9dc7d79abd864e8abbcdfafa33db2ed6502", "event": "finished", "latency_ms": 5523, "finished_at": "2026-10-03T16:07:15.927997+00:00", "http_status": 200, "reported_model": "gemini-3.8-flash", "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 2139, "completion_tokens": 913, "total_tokens": 3052, "reasoning_tokens": 576}, "reply": "这是一个可以直接运行的简洁示例：\n\n```python\nimport asyncio\n\nasync def fetch_success(task_id: int) -> str:\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    return f\"任务 {task_id} 执行成功\"\n\nasync def fetch_fail(task_id: int) -> str:\n    await asyncio.sleep(0.1)\n    raise ValueError(f\"任务 {task_id} 发生了预期的错误\")\n\nasync def main():\n    tasks = [\n        fetch_success(1),\n        fetch_fail(2),\n        fetch_success(3),\n    ]\n\n    # 设置 return_exceptions=True，异常会被当作结果返回，不会中断其它任务\n    results = await asyncio.gather(*tasks, return_exceptions=True)\n\n    # 遍历结果并区分正常值与异常\n    for index, result in enumerate(results, start=1):\n        if isinstance(result, Exception):\n            print(f\"[{index}] 失败: 捕获到异常 {type(result).__name__} -> {result}\")\n        else:\n            print(f\"[{index}] 成功: 返回结果 -> {result}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    asyncio.run(main())\n```\n\n运行后，即使第 2 个任务抛出了 `ValueError`，第 3 个任务依然会正常完成，返回的列表里对应第 2 项就是该异常实例，通过 `isinstance(result, Exception)` 就能轻松筛选处理了。", "finish_reason": "stop"}
